.venv/
*.pyc
__pycache__/
# Node dumps. These carry POSITIONS for every node the radio has heard, which
# is other people's location data as well as the local node. Never commit one.
# The pattern is deliberately broad: meshchat-nodes.json was listed and
# serial-nodes.json was not, so a 144-node dump with coordinates would have
# gone in.
nodes.json
*-nodes.json
*nodes*.json
*.pre-*

# The real exclusion list names the OWNER'S OWN devices, and this repo is
# public. Node ids are broadcast on the air, so they are not secret in
# themselves, but a file saying "this id is carried by me and this one is at my
# house" is the name-to-place link the list exists to prevent. Ship the example,
# keep yours local. own-nodes.example.txt documents the format.
own-nodes.txt
fresh-ids.json
